<h1>HabitTracker — Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>

<h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
<p>When you sign in with Google, we collect your email address and Google user ID to sync your data. We also store your habits, streaks, and progress in Firebase.</p>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
<p>Your data is used only to sync your habits and progress across devices. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

<h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We use Google Firebase for data storage and Google Play Billing for in-app purchases. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

<h2>4. Data Deletion</h2>
<p>You can delete your data at any time by contacting us or signing out of your account in the app.</p>

<h2>5. Contact</h2>
<p>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/sveteroc24-max">github.com/sveteroc24-max</a></p>
